OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786097898
OL,3,CWoman tried to smuggle cannabis worth
OL,4,C#500,000 into the UK in two suitcases
OL,6,FA woman from Devon has admitted
OL,7,Fattempting to smuggle cannabis with a
OL,8,Fstreet value of more than half a
OL,9,Fmillion pounds into the UK inside two
OL,10,Fsuitcases.
OL,12,FAmy Durban from Hemyock near
OL,13,FCullompton was arrested by Border
OL,14,FForce officers on 6 July at Heathrow
OL,15,FAirport after arriving from Bangkok.
OL,17,FThe 45-year-old's two suitcases were
OL,18,Fstuffed with 51.2kg of cannabis that
OL,19,Fhad a street value of at least
OL,20,F#512,000.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
