OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786097898
OL,3,CWoman tried to smuggle cannabis worth
OL,4,C#500,000 into the UK in two suitcases
OL,6,FToday (Thursday, 6 August) at
OL,7,FIsleworth Crown Court she pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to smuggling Class B drugs. She
OL,9,Fwas remanded in custody and will be
OL,10,Fsentenced on 14 October.
OL,12,FMark Abbott, a senior investigating
OL,13,Fofficer from the National Crime
OL,14,FAgency, said: "There are really bad
OL,15,Foutcomes at home and abroad when
OL,16,Fcouriers are caught smuggling
OL,17,Fcannabis. As well as time in prison, a
OL,18,Flife-changing conviction will damage
OL,19,Ffuture career and travel prospects.
OL,26,@vD@OOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
