OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786097898
OL,3,CWoman tried to smuggle cannabis worth
OL,4,C#500,000 into the UK in two suitcases
OL,6,F"People should understand that these
OL,7,Fcrime groups use profits from cannabis
OL,8,Fsmuggling to fund the trafficking of
OL,9,Fother drugs too. All of those drugs
OL,10,Ffuel wider crime in our communities
OL,11,Fand have a toxic effect on people's
OL,12,Flives."
OL,14,FThe National Crime Agency say there
OL,15,Fhas been an explosion in the number of
OL,16,Fdrug couriers trying to smuggle
OL,17,Fcannabis into the country, fuelled by
OL,18,Fdemand for drugs.
OL,20,FIn 2023, 142 cannabis smugglers were
OL,21,Fcaught arriving in the UK by plane.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@GO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
