OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786097898
OL,3,CWoman tried to smuggle cannabis worth
OL,4,C#500,000 into the UK in two suitcases
OL,6,FIn 2024 that number rocketed to 801 `
OL,7,Fa 464% increase. The figure rose again
OL,8,Fin 2025 to 976. And 2026 is on track
OL,9,Fto be even worse with 600 air
OL,10,Fpassenger couriers arrested at UK
OL,11,Fairports in the first six months alone.
OL,13,FDurban's conviction comes after the
OL,14,FNCA and partners in Thailand last
OL,15,Fmonth announced a new crackdown in the
OL,16,Fcountry.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
