OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786097898
OL,3,CWoman tried to smuggle cannabis worth
OL,4,C#500,000 into the UK in two suitcases
OL,6,FThe NCA say couriers are usually
OL,7,Fapproached on social media by
OL,8,Forganised crime groups who offer a
OL,9,F'free' holiday and spending money in
OL,10,Fexchange for taking cannabis home.
OL,11,FOnce back in the UK other criminals
OL,12,Fwill take the drugs from the courier
OL,13,Fand move them on.
OL,15,FThose caught in Thailand trying to
OL,16,Fsmuggle cannabis now face huge fines `
OL,17,Faround #680 per kg. The 'average'
OL,18,Fsmuggler is caught in Thailand with
OL,19,F26kg ` equalling a fine of #17,680. If
OL,20,Fit isn't paid, the smuggler will go to
OL,21,Fjail for up to two years in Thailand.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
