CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786097898
OL,3,CWoman tried to smuggle cannabis worth
OL,4,C#500,000 into the UK in two suitcases
OL,6,FThe NCA has launched a new social
OL,7,Fmedia campaign warning young people
OL,8,Fthat smuggling cannabis from Thailand
OL,9,Fto the UK could land them in a foreign
OL,10,Fjail.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
